{"id":"732a8dcd1c0cf572","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-langlands-classification.md","title":"Langlands Classification","display":"df-langlands-classification — Langlands Classification","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-langlands-classification","aliases":["58-df-langlands-classification"],"display":"df-langlands-classification — Langlands Classification","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-langlands-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-langlands-classification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-langlands-classification — Langlands Classification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,P,M,A,N,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi,I\\in V\">\\(G,P,M,A,N,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（实约化群或非阿基米德局部域上约化群的原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=MAN\">\\(P=MAN\\)</span> 及其相对于固定最小抛物子群为标准的带类型数据）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（Levi 因子上的不可约 tempered 表示原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathfrak a_{P,\\mathbb C}^*\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathfrak a_{P,\\mathbb C}^*\\)</span> 且实部位于开正 Weyl 室的原语）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（标准模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\operatorname{Ind}_P^G(\\sigma\\otimes e^\\nu\\otimes1)\">\\(I=\\operatorname{Ind}_P^G(\\sigma\\otimes e^\\nu\\otimes1)\\)</span> 的值关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（给定环境群的唯一不可约商关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（此处定义的 Langlands 数据谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S(G,P,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\exists M,A,N,I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S(P,M,A,N,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S(\\sigma,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S(\\nu,P,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S(I,G,P,\\sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S(\\pi,I,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S(G,P,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\exists M,A,N,I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S(P,M,A,N,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S(\\sigma,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S(\\nu,P,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S(I,G,P,\\sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S(\\pi,I,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Langlands 分类断言每个不可约 admissible 表示都是某个标准模的唯一不可约商；数据在标准共轭意义下唯一。</li>\n<li>标准模本身通常可约，所以不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 直接等同于诱导表示。</li>\n<li>tempered 不等同于平方可积；离散级数是 tempered 表示中的更小类别。</li>\n<li>该分类不等同于完整 unitary dual 的分类，标准模的唯一商也未必幺正。</li>\n<li>本原子讨论局部表示论的 Langlands quotient，不把局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-参数或全局自守对应混入同一断言。</li>\n<li>旧断言中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,A,N\">\\(M,A,N\\)</span> 是自由符号，标准模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(P,\\sigma,\\nu)\">\\(I(P,\\sigma,\\nu)\\)</span> 也是未约束的部分函数；现均改为存在量化的数据与值关系。</li>\n<li>书中现有 reductive-group 与 parabolic-subgroup 原子只处理带底域运算的代数群，不能直接充当实群或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-进群的局部 Langlands 分类接口，因此不再保留误导性依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,P,M,A,N,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"P=MAN","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\mathfrak a_{P,\\mathbb C}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\operatorname{Ind}_P^G(\\sigma\\otimes e^\\nu\\otimes1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}langlands\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\n&\\mathrm{LanglandsParameter}_S(G,P,\\sigma,\\nu,\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\mathrm{LocalReductiveGroup}_S(G)\n\\land\\exists M,A,N,I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StandardLanglandsParabolic}_S(P,M,A,N,G)\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{TemperedRepresentation}_S(\\sigma,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{PositiveChamberParameter}_S(\\nu,P,A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{27mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{NormalizedParabolicInduction}_S(I,G,P,\\sigma,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{UniqueIrreducibleQuotient}_S(\\pi,I,G)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"M,A,N","display":false},{"tex":"I(P,\\sigma,\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2630,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-753","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-langlands-classification.md|58-df-langlands-classification]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":[]}